  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Are you hoping to make me regret something by showing me this dagger?
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'What do you mean, regret? '
  - speaker: 1
    text: "I have nothing to regret anyway... and I don\u2019t have to tell you anything
      about this story.  "
  - speaker: 1
    text: Anyway, she knew very well that what she was doing was against our faith.
